    <p>The Service integrates with or relies on third-party services including but not limited to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>MCP client providers (for example Anthropic's Claude, OpenAI's ChatGPT) — these connect to your tunnel via OAuth. We facilitate the authentication flow but do not control how these providers process data once it reaches them.</li>
      <li>Cloudflare, for network edge TLS termination and DDoS protection.</li>
      <li>Our payment provider, merchant of record for payments — see "Payments, Refunds, and Cancellation" above.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We are not responsible for the availability, terms, or policies of these third-party services.</p>

